     Specify the position of secondary subtitles on the screen. This is similar
     to ``--sub-pos`` but for secondary subtitles.
 
+``--secondary-sub-scale=<0-100>``
+    Scale secondary subtitles independently of ``--sub-scale`` (default: 1).
+    Uses the secondary ASS override mode. Text subtitles still use the shared
+    base font size; clients that need an absolute secondary size should divide
+    the desired font size by ``--sub-font-size``. For styled ASS subtitles in
+    scale mode, this scales their original size. Bitmap subtitles are scaled
+    as images rather than re-rendered text.
+
